				</Value>
				<Value Code="TX">
					<Title>TWX</Title>
					<Description>Communication service involving Teletypewriter machines connected by wire or electronic transmission media. Teletypewriter machines are the devices used to send and receive signals and produce hardcopy from them.</Description>
