					<Description>Place where it has been decided to prolong the delivery delay.</Description>
				</Value>
				<Value Code="110">
					<Title>Recharging place/location</Title>
					<Description>Place/location where a consignment has been changed of destination and is subject to a recharge note. (Complementary orders to modify the routing of the transport may be given, upon which a new charge calculation may be applied by the carrier).</Description>
				</Value>
				<Value Code="111">
					<Title>Customs office of despatch</Title>
					<Description>Customs office from which goods are despatched between countries of a Customs union.</Description>
				</Value>
