			<Description>Code specifying the means of payment guarantee.</Description>
			<Values>
				<Value Code="1">
					<Title>Factor guarantee</Title>
					<Description>Payment of an invoice is made by a factor under the guarantee he issued to seller or to another factor.</Description>
