					<Description>The transaction exceeds a default credit limit.</Description>
				</Value>
				<Value Code="101">
					<Title>Transaction received and redirected to another bank and/or</Title>
					<Description>account The transaction has been received, but has been redirected to another bank and/or account.</Description>
